          <p source="#source-190320-190352"><seg source="#source-190320-190352">春のすゑのさみしや。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-190352-190375"><seg source="#source-190352-190375">酒をしぼる男の</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-190375-190406"><seg source="#source-190375-190406">肌さへもひとしほ。</seg></p>
        </div>
