          <p source="#source-190770-190802"><seg source="#source-190770-190802">わかき男の手にあり。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-190802-190885"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-190802-190817"><rb>櫂</rb><rt>かい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-190817-190832">をそろへて</seg><hi rend="bouten 傍点 right" source="#source-190832-190880" corresp="#source-190844-190880"><seg source="#source-190832-190844">やんさの</seg></hi><seg source="#source-190880-190885">、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-190885-190922"><seg source="#source-190885-190922">そなた戀しと鳴らせる。</seg></p>
