          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-190983-191018"><seg source="#source-190983-191018">麥の穗づらにさす日か、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191018-191071"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191018-191051"><rb>酒屋男</rb><rt>さかやをとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191051-191071">にさす日か、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191071-191106"><seg source="#source-191071-191106">輕ろく投げやるこころの</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191106-191146"><seg source="#source-191106-191146">けふをかぎりのあひびき。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-191146-191207" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
          <div>
            <head n="3" source="#source-191167-191203"><seg source="#source-191167-191170">６</seg></head>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-191207-191236"><seg source="#source-191207-191236">人の生るるもとすら</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191236-191286"><seg source="#source-191236-191245">知らぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191245-191266"><rb>女子</rb><rt>をなご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191266-191286">のこころに、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191286-191330"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191286-191298"><rb>誰</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191298-191330">が馴れ初めし、酒屋の</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191330-191370"><seg source="#source-191330-191370">にほひか、麥のむせびか。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-191370-191431" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
          <div>
            <head n="3" source="#source-191391-191427"><seg source="#source-191391-191394">７</seg></head>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-191431-191466"><seg source="#source-191431-191466">からしの花も實となり、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191466-191501"><seg source="#source-191466-191501">麥もそろそろ刈らるる。</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191501-191533"><seg source="#source-191501-191533">かくしてはやも五月は</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191533-191582"><seg source="#source-191533-191536">酒</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191536-191554"><rb>量</rb><rt>はか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191554-191582">る手にあふるる。</seg></p>
        </div>
        <div type="layout" source="#source-191582-191643" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
          <div>
            <head n="3" source="#source-191603-191639"><seg source="#source-191603-191606">８</seg></head>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p source="#source-191643-191699"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191643-191658"><rb>櫨</rb><rt>はじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191658-191661">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191661-191679"><rb>實採</rb><rt>みと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191679-191699">りの來る日に</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191699-191749"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-191699-191717"><rb>百舌</rb><rt>もず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-191717-191749">啼き、人もなげきぬ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191749-191781"><seg source="#source-191749-191781">酒をつくるは朝あけ、</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-191781-191818"><seg source="#source-191781-191818">君へかよふは日のくれ。</seg></p>
        </div>
